                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9d8280a2-ef24-3c3d-bd64-88dc4a99ff8c",
                        "entry_id": "b0f446f5-d98d-3bdc-9dab-869ddd5059e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "юр. в гражданском праве: определённые материальные блага (деньги, имущество и т. п.), предоставляемые по соглашению сторон взамен исполнения обязательства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e3f444e-8ac4-46e8-b99d-82c6423116f3",
                                "sense_id": "9d8280a2-ef24-3c3d-bd64-88dc4a99ff8c",
                                "text": "— Оттого, что у него стачки с купцами; он дал отступного. Я со всеми ими имел дела, я их знаю. Ведь это не купцы, а барышники. Он и не пойдёт на дело, где ему предстоит десять, пятнадцать процентов, а он ждёт, чтобы купить за двадцать копеек рубль."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "314c182b-cea4-4a72-a797-62b08b1ded22",
                                "sense_id": "9d8280a2-ef24-3c3d-bd64-88dc4a99ff8c",
                                "text": "Андрей. Ну, так что ж? Торговаться ты, что ль, хочешь, отступного, просишь?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b35c7a37-81a0-4f4a-9680-1975445acd38",
                                "sense_id": "9d8280a2-ef24-3c3d-bd64-88dc4a99ff8c",
                                "text": "Он мне четвертную бумажку отступного сулил, а я трёхсот с него не брал."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e0d0a56-eca5-450a-94f9-4fa908ac76cf",
                        "source_entry_id": "b0f446f5-d98d-3bdc-9dab-869ddd5059e0",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d8280a2-ef24-3c3d-bd64-88dc4a99ff8c",
                        "target_lang_word": "compensation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "compensation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "660eff43-db2c-387b-871b-f002215de9de",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act or principle of compensating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e25132c-91f7-4b14-a46f-194bf81804d9",
                                                "sense_id": "660eff43-db2c-387b-871b-f002215de9de",
                                                "text": "Human labor, through all its forms, from the sharpening of a stake to the construction of a city or an epic, is one immense illustration of the perfect compensation of the universe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56288dae-ba36-33d3-80a1-ef200e3bbda8",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which is regarded as an equivalent; something which compensates for loss."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e057567-a91d-4e62-aae3-193302460541",
                                                "sense_id": "56288dae-ba36-33d3-80a1-ef200e3bbda8",
                                                "text": "The parliament which dissolved the monastic foundations […] vouchsafed not a word toward securing the slightest compensation to the dispossessed owners."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c39a795f-5bd2-4b9b-96ac-6d01ded75b6b",
                                                "sense_id": "56288dae-ba36-33d3-80a1-ef200e3bbda8",
                                                "text": "No pecuniary compensation can possibly reward them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8069b45b-f696-31fd-ad7b-e9d7e5355639",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The extinction of debts of which two persons are reciprocally debtors by the credits of which they are reciprocally creditors; the payment of a debt by a credit of equal amount."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df6d9c09-8c2a-30ea-a4cc-32558a684ce0",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A recompense or reward for service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ea090c9-babd-332a-9aa1-08fa55e3dbde",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An equivalent stipulated for in contracts for the sale of real estate, in which it is customary to provide that errors in description, etc., shall not avoid, but shall be the subject of compensation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d24f41c5-5a60-31ed-b6d6-1b0303287411",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The relationship between air temperature outside a building and a calculated target temperature for provision of air or water to contained rooms or spaces for the purpose of efficient heating. In building control systems, the compensation curve is defined to a compensator for this purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9a2cb70-dac7-3e71-a05c-7399dfe3ae5e",
                                        "entry_id": "7c51177e-2232-3063-a702-91ac60b8b7c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability of one part of the brain to overfunction in order to take over the function of a damaged part (e.g. following a stroke)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
